PK␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀ÃœÐqÙ␀␀Ù␀␀ì␀␀␀f020-even-leading-odd-tail-public-20261021_v1/accepted-history/history-c86929554da6cba6/f020-single-leading-digit-comparison/dependencies/accepted-theorem/dependencies/leading-two/dependencies/even-low-digit/exploratory-review/README.md# Even low-digit route verification

This sealed package independently checks the mathematical route and exact controls for the author candidate n=p^r+2c+1, odd prime p, r>=2, s>r, 1<=2c+1<p. It includes the requested n=p^r+1 case.

VERDICT.json is a PASS for route verification, not the separate fresh final acceptance. The concurrent reviewer/author overlap is disclosed in Section 9 of INDEPENDENT_REVIEW.md and in the retained author ATTRIBUTION.md. A distinct reviewer is responsible for the fresh full-family frozen-byte acceptance.

The audit found no mathematical gap in the scoped claim. It verifies original ordinary H/P derivatives, the complete root cover, and algebraic-square kernel nonvanishing. It does not assert global F020/F023 closure or arbitrary-degree closure.

Reproduction commands, run from this directory:

    python check_integer_bounds.py
    python check_center_hulls.py
    python check_recorded_units.py
    python check_original_identities.py
    python verify_frozen.py

The isolated author replay is under author_replay/. Its check output is AUTHOR_REPLAY.log. Independent controls import no author checker. Running scripts can rewrite outputs and therefore invalidate the frozen MANIFEST until resealed.
