Read INDEPENDENT_ATTRIBUTION_REVIEW.md for the exact reviewed hashes and scoped acceptance. The review accepts attribution and bounded source mappings only: it is not a novelty verdict, an exhaustive literature search, or a second audit of the underlying mathematics.

Run `python check_independent.py` with Python 3 and SymPy for the independent finite controls and manifest checks. No source package is modified. SOURCE_BINDING.json binds the reviewed comparison and accepted mathematics. The review itself is sealed by MANIFEST.json and SEAL.sha256.
