PK␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀5a$c␀␀c␀␀J␀␀␀f020-even-leading-odd-tail-public-20261021_v1/independent-review/README.md# Independent mixed-parity review

Accepted only for the exact theorem and author pins in VERDICT.json. Read INDEPENDENT_REVIEW.md for the uniform mathematical audit. Finite controls are not the proof.

All files here are reviewer-authored or reviewer-generated. No candidate or historical source program is imported by independent_controls.py. Historical source programs were not executed. Candidate snapshots remain with the separately supplied author package.

Verification: python verify_review.py --manifest EXPECTED_REVIEW_MANIFEST_SHA256
Author bytes: python verify_author.py PATH_TO_FROZEN_AUTHOR
Full original-source read-only audit, where those local source roots are available: append --originals.
Fresh new-author and independent controls: python replay_controls.py PATH_TO_FROZEN_AUTHOR
Disposable inventory mutations: python check_inventory_mutations.py PATH_TO_FROZEN_AUTHOR

replay_controls.py copies only inspected control scripts to temporary directories, applies explicit resource limits, and compares author output byte-for-byte and independent output semantically excluding timing only. The existing result files are unchanged. The standalone independent_controls.py writes INDEPENDENT_RESULTS.json beside itself; run it from a disposable copy when verifying this sealed release.

This review does not authorize external publication or any unrelated action.
